| HMA image after offset 0010h | 40,624 | — | copied to `FFFF:0010` |
| LAST | 1,147 | — | discarded initialization |

### Low-prefix composition

| Segment | Bytes below boundary | Role |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| START | 3 | loader entry |
| CONSTANTS | 512 | resident constants |
| DATA | 1,783 | resident mutable data |
| TABLE | 2,011 | resident dispatch/data tables |
| CODE | 157 | low entry, driver, and interrupt gateway code |
| Inter-segment alignment | 1 | linker padding |
| **Total** | **4,467** | `DOS_LOW_GATE_END` |

